### ==============================================================================
### GameStore API - HTTP Request Tests
### Digunakan untuk menguji endpoint API (misal dengan VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5172
### ==============================================================================

### 1. GET all games
### Mengambil seluruh daftar ringkasan game beserta nama genre
GET http://localhost:5172/games

### 2. GET game by ID
### Mengambil detail satu game berdasarkan ID
GET http://localhost:5172/games/1

### 3. GET all genres
### Mengambil seluruh daftar genre yang tersedia
GET http://localhost:5172/genres

### 4. POST create game
### Menambahkan data game baru ke database
POST http://localhost:5172/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Title": "Game baru banget bangor",
  "Description": "Burger bangor",
  "GenreId": 2,
  "Price": 1.99,
  "ReleaseDate": "2028-11-11"
}

### 5. PUT update game
### Memperbarui data game berdasarkan ID
PUT http://localhost:5172/games/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Title": "Game Title 1 Changed",
  "Description": "Game Description 1 Changed",
  "GenreId": 1,
  "Price": 49.99,
  "ReleaseDate": "2045-01-01"
}

### 6. DELETE game
### Menghapus data game berdasarkan ID
DELETE http://localhost:5172/games/3